mindmap
  root((Tuning Jev thresholds))
    1 · Decision
      What action does yes trigger?
        is_queue → queue 3 things
        ask_user → bother the user
      Which error hurts more?
        costly FP → high threshold
        costly FN → low threshold
      One threshold per question, never global
    2 · Labeled cases
      Golden set: the 25 REQUESTS
      Positives and negatives by hand
      Include trap cases
        metallica one
        yellow from cold play
    3 · Measure, don't guess
      List score per case and label
      Find the gap
        true positives ≥ 0.91
        false positives ≤ 0.59
        gap 0.6–0.9 → 0.8
      No gap → the question is badly phrased
        needs_clarification was noise
    4 · Stability
      Run it 3 times
      Stable near 0.5 → real doubt
        yellow: 0.51 · 0.56 · 0.52
      Flips between runs → don't trust it
        metallica: artist 0.46 → track 0.52
    5 · Three zones
      Clear yes → act
      Clear no → ignore
      Gray zone → fallback
        catalog lookup
        pass the doubt to the LLM
        ask the user
      Doubtful route voids its dependents
        nada → energy very chill 0.70
    6 · Which number to read
      noul → the probability
      choice → confidence and top1 vs top2 margin
        metallica 0.34 vs 0.28 = tie
      score → confidence, not the score
        energy 0.27 → null
    7 · Maintain
      Re-run the golden set after every change
      Adding questions shifts others
        yellow lost has_artist
      Anti-patterns
        0.5 by default
        tuning on a single example
        ignoring confidence
